  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Navigation sphere.</p>\n<p>You discreetly scout ahead, consult with other navigators, or call upon favors with other travelers to obtain maps of an area. You may spend a plan to learn the layout of a certain area such as a dungeon, forest, canyon, neighborhood, building, or other location.</p>\n<p>This gives you a detailed, single-page map of the area, although it might not include secret or fine details. If the area is smaller than a 100-foot cube, you may attempt one Perception or Survival check to attempt to locate each hazard, mechanical trap, or secret door in the mapped area as part of revealing the plan. The GM makes each roll on your behalf secretly.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc52\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
